                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 669,
                            "last_played": 1792535676
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "After 10 hours of gameplay I was starting to hit my stride.  Preparing soups ahead of time, cutting lemons and onions before service.  I start to get into dishes where you're transferring sauces and stir frys and I want to throw my computer out the window.  After mixing and frying and flipping, you click on a dish funny and end up dropping the whole plate and spilling its contents.  I am not making another sauce.  This game was a lot of fun in the beginning but the jank thoroughly ruins it when you get into complicated dishes.  You can also click the wrong dish when serving it for some reason which is an interesting choice.\n\nI would honestly pick a different cooking game, this one does not feel great.",
